The tree navigation retrieval in src/rag/tree/ (buildDocumentTree, TreeNavigationRetriever,
TwoStageRetriever, navigate_document) is an independent TypeScript implementation of the method of
PageIndex ("vectorless", reasoning-based RAG: an LLM-navigated table-of-contents tree per document).
Its tree-search and document-selection prompts are adapted from PageIndex's.

PageIndex — https://github.com/VectifyAI/PageIndex

